---

import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="section section-welcome">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">

      <!-- Image -->
      <Image
        src="/img/mobil1.jpeg"
        alt="Jasa sedot WC Alam Jaya Tangerang profesional 24 jam"
        width="535"
        height="442"
        format="webp"
        quality={45}
        class="w-auto h-auto rounded-xl"
      />

      <!-- Content -->
      <div>

        <p class="mb-3 text-main font-semibold">
          Jasa Sedot WC Alam Jaya Tangerang
        </p>

        <h2>
          Layanan Sedot WC Profesional & Terpercaya di Tangerang
        </h2>

        <p>
          Sedot WC Alam Jaya merupakan jasa sedot WC terpercaya yang melayani
          wilayah Tangerang dan sekitarnya. Kami menyediakan layanan penyedotan
          septic tank, WC mampet, saluran pembuangan tersumbat, serta perawatan
          sanitasi untuk rumah, kantor, ruko, restoran, apartemen, dan kawasan
          industri.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-4">
          Dengan armada yang siap beroperasi 24 jam, kami memberikan pelayanan
          cepat, aman, dan profesional dengan harga yang transparan untuk
          membantu mengatasi berbagai masalah saluran pembuangan Anda.
        </p>


        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 my-6 gap-4">

          <div class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] items-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark p-4 rounded gap-4">
            <div class="bg-main text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg">
              Melayani 24 Jam
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] items-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark p-4 rounded gap-4">
            <div class="bg-main text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg">
              Area Tangerang & Sekitar
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] items-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark p-4 rounded gap-4">
            <div class="bg-main text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg">
              Teknisi Berpengalaman
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] items-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark p-4 rounded gap-4">
            <div class="bg-main text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg">
              Harga Terjangkau
            </p>
          </div>


          <div class="grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] items-center bg-gray-50 dark:bg-dark p-4 rounded gap-4">
            <div class="bg-main text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5">
              <Icon name="lucide:check" />
            </div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-lg">
              Respon Cepat
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>


        <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-sm mx-auto sm:mx-0">

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6289531934761"
            target="_blank"
            class="btn bg-main border-main text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-green-600"
          >
            Hubungi Kami
          </a>

          <a
            href="#services"
            class="btn btn-outline rounded-lg"
          >
            Lihat Layanan
          </a>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>